{"id":"ghost","name":{"en":"Ghost","ja":"ゴースト"},"desc":{"en":"The will of the dead materialized somehow to create this abomination. It's supposed to be a ghost, but it can be seen, heard, and touched.","ja":"未練を残して死んだ何者かの意志が宿ったモノ。限りなく幽霊に近い存在だが、ちゃんと触れるし攻撃も通じる。最早、倒すことでしか供養できないので、出会った時は遠慮なく。"},"race":"Ghost","hp":100,"atk":49,"defen":20,"spd":26,"level":23,"locations":[{"id":"arland-area","name":{"en":"Arland Area","ja":"アーランド周辺地域"}},{"id":"continental-coastline","name":{"en":"Continental Coastline","ja":"大陸海岸線"}},{"id":"northern-ruins","name":{"en":"Northern Ruins","ja":"北方遺跡"}},{"id":"ancient-monastery","name":{"en":"Ancient Monastery","ja":"古の修道院"},"parent":"northern-ruins"},{"id":"forgotten-village","name":{"en":"Forgotten Village","ja":"忘れられた村"},"parent":"northern-ruins"}],"isDX":false,"index":19}